# Dragging
A basic example, where we make a point draggable and update other primitives based on the current position:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
# Dragging
A basic example, where we make a point draggable and update other primitives based on the current position:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: false
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
target = {0.5,0.5};

Graphics[{
  Red, PointSize[0.1], 
  EventHandler[Point[{{0.5,0.5}}], { 
    "drag" -> Function[x, target = x] 
  }],
  Line[{{0,0}, target // Offload}]
}, PlotRange->{{-1,1}, {-1,1}}, 
  "TransitionDuration"->300]

